- labels and references

@anchor1 First labeled node
  (means) this node has a label

@anchor2 Second labeled node
  (e.g.) labeled nodes can be referenced

$anchor1.1 Reference to first labeled node
  (note) this resolves to anchor1

Normal unlabeled node
  (means) no label here

@anchor3 Third labeled node

$anchor2.1 Reference to second labeled node

$anchor3.1 Forward reference resolved after parsing
